* The Mellin term identity (Lean ` Fterm_eq_term ` ): ` ( G X ^ W ) ( A Y ^ -u ( S + W ) ) = ( A Y ^ -u S ) ( G ( Y / X ) ^ -u W ) ` for positive reals ` X ` , ` Y ` (~ cxpaddd , ~ divcxpd , ~ cxpnegd ).

s1::id |- ( ( ( Y e. RR+ /\ X e. RR+ ) /\ ( S e. CC /\ W e. CC ) /\ ( A e. CC /\ G e. CC ) ) -> ( ( Y e. RR+ /\ X e. RR+ ) /\ ( S e. CC /\ W e. CC ) /\ ( A e. CC /\ G e. CC ) ) )
